                                                "sense_id": "884627cf-cf36-38d0-8666-9f2444151c58",
                                                "text": "Escargots, smoked salmon, fresh seafood, and pasta are all presented in succulent style, and the price is right."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "442128cf-bff4-4076-a91c-f756d228d4df",
                                                "sense_id": "884627cf-cf36-38d0-8666-9f2444151c58",
                                                "text": "“Ah. Good evening, sir. Can I interest you in a meal? A succulent Chinese meal?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "715516bc-2e38-3c80-84bf-b90bd0dd8cf3",
                                        "entry_id": "877983e4-65c4-3a83-bf05-38958ddde0d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Luscious or delectable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca092038-3897-45c5-8813-c8d311820bc0",
                                                "sense_id": "715516bc-2e38-3c80-84bf-b90bd0dd8cf3",
                                                "text": "\"Hotter Than That,\" written by his wife, Lil Hardin, who had dandy rhythm herself, is scat vocal a la king, as Armstrong trades succulent phrases with guitar whiz Lonnie Johnson before offering a brief but telling solo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "948666b8-02b2-4baf-99dd-ad63ef836251",
                                                "sense_id": "715516bc-2e38-3c80-84bf-b90bd0dd8cf3",
                                                "text": "It could be a verse from God's word that darts straight to the need of your heart with its succulent comfort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "571510d2-ec1f-438f-ac50-43258d8bd936",
                                                "sense_id": "715516bc-2e38-3c80-84bf-b90bd0dd8cf3",
                                                "text": "Not far from me, I noticed a succulent blond."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fa6640f-4b5f-46d2-9344-a296a9aafe40",
                                                "sense_id": "715516bc-2e38-3c80-84bf-b90bd0dd8cf3",
                                                "text": "Let go of the titles and just be the succulent woman you are each moment changing anew."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d52eefc-3696-47c9-8efa-fbfcdd76a6e4",
                                                "sense_id": "715516bc-2e38-3c80-84bf-b90bd0dd8cf3",
                                                "text": "It will get a hard-on even if its owner sees a one-breasted woman with no teeth, and squinty eyes, just as long as she holds promise of a nice behind, agreeable thighs — a succulent woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e430bf0-e485-46ba-bd97-05d1003ce9d9",
                                                "sense_id": "715516bc-2e38-3c80-84bf-b90bd0dd8cf3",
                                                "text": "The peaceful revolution was achieved in the United States following 1820, largely under the guise of succulent phrases and legal technicalities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0f0304e-7e05-39e6-af9f-e5a1587a7db8",
                                        "entry_id": "877983e4-65c4-3a83-bf05-38958ddde0d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having fleshy leaves or other tissues that store water."
                                        ],
